{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Type Registration.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Type Registration.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender operator type registration blender operator type registration","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Type Registration.md","fileName":"Blender Operator Type Registration.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Operator Type Registration","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender Operator and Event System]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Operator and Event System","Blender Operator Type Structure","Blender Operator Registration Path","Blender Operator Type Registry","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Type Registration.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Type Registration.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender operator type registration blender operator type registration","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Operator Type Registration.md","fileName":"Blender Operator Type Registration.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Operator Type Registration","heading":"Blender Operator Type Registration","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Operator type registration creates a blank [[Blender Operator Type Structure]], calls an operation-specific function to populate its identity, callbacks, flags, and RNA properties, and then completes the record's insertion into the global registry.\n\nEditors collect related registration functions through their space type's operator callback, while the window manager registers application-level operations. The [[Blender Operator Registration Path]] shows how this work is reached during startup, and the result